{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-60463","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90228","text":"FleetPrompt — The Open Agent Marketplace"}]},{"id":"blk-60464","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90229","text":"Discover, publish, and install production-ready AI agents. Built on trust scores, versioned manifests, and one-click deployment."}]},{"id":"blk-60465","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90230","text":"Source-of-truth spec"}]},{"id":"blk-60466","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60468","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90231","marks":["code"],"text":"docs/spec/README.md"},{"id":"spn-90232","text":" — FleetPrompt technical specification"}]}],"id":"blk-60467","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60470","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90233","marks":["code"],"text":"prompts/BUILD.md"},{"id":"spn-90234","text":" — Implementation build prompt (9 phases)"}]}],"id":"blk-60469","kind":"list-item"}],"kind":"list","ordered":false},{"id":"blk-60471","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90235","text":"Stack"}]},{"id":"blk-60472","kind":"code","language":"text","text":"Language:     Elixir 1.17+ / OTP 27\nFramework:    Phoenix 1.8 (LiveView for UI, PubSub for trust broadcasts)\nDatabase:     PostgreSQL via shared Supabase (fleet.* schema, migrations 030-039)\nSearch:       pg_trgm + ts_vector (no external search infra)\nHot Cache:    ETS (:fp_manifests, :fp_trust_scores, :fp_search_index, :fp_categories)\nBackground:   Oban (trust recompute, webhook delivery, search index refresh)\nAuth:         Supabase Auth (shared [&] ecosystem — amp.profiles, amp.workspaces)\nDeploy:       Mix release + Docker on Fly.io"},{"id":"blk-60473","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90236","text":"Build commands"}]},{"id":"blk-60474","kind":"code","language":"bash","text":"mix deps.get\nmix compile --warnings-as-errors\nmix format --check-formatted\nmix test                          # requires running Supabase for DB tests\nmix test test/fleet_prompt/       # unit tests (no DB required for most)"},{"id":"blk-60475","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90237","text":"Key modules"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-60477","spans":[{"id":"spn-90238","text":"Module"}]},{"id":"blk-60478","spans":[{"id":"spn-90239","text":"Purpose"}]}],"id":"blk-60476","kind":"table","rows":[[{"id":"blk-60479","spans":[{"id":"spn-90240","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Registry"}]},{"id":"blk-60480","spans":[{"id":"spn-90241","text":"Agent + manifest CRUD, version immutability, status transitions"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60481","spans":[{"id":"spn-90242","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Engine"}]},{"id":"blk-60482","spans":[{"id":"spn-90243","text":"4-signal weighted trust computation (test 30%, spec 25%, usage 25%, audit 20%)"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60483","spans":[{"id":"spn-90244","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Worker"}]},{"id":"blk-60484","spans":[{"id":"spn-90245","text":"GenServer per agent — recomputes, caches in ETS, broadcasts via PubSub"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60485","spans":[{"id":"spn-90246","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Trust.Supervisor"}]},{"id":"blk-60486","spans":[{"id":"spn-90247","text":"DynamicSupervisor managing TrustWorkers"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60487","spans":[{"id":"spn-90248","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Search"}]},{"id":"blk-60488","spans":[{"id":"spn-90249","text":"pg_trgm + ts_vector full-text search with filters"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60489","spans":[{"id":"spn-90250","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Forks"}]},{"id":"blk-60490","spans":[{"id":"spn-90251","text":"Fork-and-customize with provenance tracking"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60491","spans":[{"id":"spn-90252","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.PipelineIntake"}]},{"id":"blk-60492","spans":[{"id":"spn-90253","text":"ConsolidationEvent processing from Agentelic"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60493","spans":[{"id":"spn-90254","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.InstallEngine"}]},{"id":"blk-60494","spans":[{"id":"spn-90255","text":"Install flow with permission checks"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60495","spans":[{"id":"spn-90256","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.AuditWriter"}]},{"id":"blk-60496","spans":[{"id":"spn-90257","text":"Append-only audit event recording"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60497","spans":[{"id":"spn-90258","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.WebhookDispatcher"}]},{"id":"blk-60498","spans":[{"id":"spn-90259","text":"Oban worker for async webhook delivery"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60499","spans":[{"id":"spn-90260","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.Cache"}]},{"id":"blk-60500","spans":[{"id":"spn-90261","text":"ETS GenServer with 4 named tables"}]}],[{"id":"blk-60501","spans":[{"id":"spn-90262","marks":["code"],"text":"FleetPrompt.MCP.Server"}]},{"id":"blk-60502","spans":[{"id":"spn-90263","text":"MCP JSON-RPC server (7 tools)"}]}]]},{"id":"blk-60503","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-90264","text":"Supabase schema"}]},{"id":"blk-60504","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90265","text":"Tables live in "},{"id":"spn-90266","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.*"},{"id":"spn-90267","text":" schema (migrations 030-039 in "},{"id":"spn-90268","marks":["code"],"text":"ampersand-supabase/migrations/"},{"id":"spn-90269","text":"):"}]},{"id":"blk-60505","items":[{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60507","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90270","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.publishers"},{"id":"spn-90271","text":" — marketplace publisher profiles"}]}],"id":"blk-60506","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60509","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90272","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agents"},{"id":"spn-90273","text":" — agent listings with search_vector"}]}],"id":"blk-60508","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60511","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90274","marks":["code"],"text":"fleet.agent_versions"},{"id":"spn-90275","text":" — semver-versioned releases with JSONB manifest"}]}],"id":"blk-60510","kind":"list-item"},{"blocks":[{"id":"blk-60513","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-90276","marks":["code